    "title": "Cavs giving Matthew Dellavedova a well-earned night of his own - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sam Amico ,\n1 days ago Bobbleheads are fun. Foam fingers are fine. But the best part of the Cavaliers’ 2026-27 promotional schedule is Matthew Dellavedova getting a night of his own. The Cavs will honor “Delly” on Dec. 12, when the Warriors visit Rocket Arena, as part of their season-long celebration of the 2016 NBA championship. It’s hard to imagine a more fitting opponent. Read full article",
